+---
+"@jini-ai/agent-plugins": minor
+---
+
+Expose the portable plugin connect, token-card, token-import, default-grant and tool-rename APIs through the existing `connect` entry. Hosts supply card identity, approval and exchange lifecycles, canonical stores and projections, activation owners, token validation and product copy. No new package dependencies are introduced.
